# Documentation & ADRs

- `docs/` is binding; **German is primary**, English mirrors live under `docs/en/`
- On DE/EN conflict, German wins (`docs/DOCUMENTATION_LANGUAGES.md`)
- Change code to match docs, not the reverse
- Non-trivial decisions need an ADR under `architecture/adr/` (`docs/ADR_GUIDE.md`)
- Milestone completion requires ROADMAP update, CHANGELOG entry, and `architecture/reviews/mN-*.md`
- Release SemVer process: `docs/RELEASE.md` (distinct from domain `docs/VERSIONING.md`)
